## 🌐 All OpenClaw CVEs by Assigning CNA (CVE List V5)

The sections lower down track CVEs that have an OpenClaw **GitHub Security Advisory** — i.e. CVEs the **project issued itself**. That is only part of the picture. A direct scan of the authoritative [CVE List V5](https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5) registry finds **{{ cna.total }}** CVEs that name OpenClaw as an affected product, the large majority assigned by **third-party researchers** rather than the project. Earlier versions of this tracker reported only the ~{{ counts.total_cves }} project-issued (GHSA-linked) CVEs and were blind to this external stream.

